Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(咚·千)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于察觉到了吗，星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.43,0:00:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的确，No.卡的所在尚未知晓。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.49,0:00:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此吾将地上世界屏障化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.69,0:00:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这个世界整个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都纳入了 No.卡的力量之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.55,0:00:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这场决斗中击倒你们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.23,0:00:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾将把 No.卡的一切尽收手中。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.65,0:00:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后过去与未来都将归吾所有。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)怎么可能让你得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.29,0:00:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咚·千，我们一定会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.12,0:00:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你打趴下！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《小鸟：游马，鲨鱼，星光！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.23,0:00:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守护我们的未来……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.34,0:00:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守护未来吧！》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.21,0:00:48.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖伏一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.23,0:00:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.09,0:00:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在获得数冥代码之力的我面前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.73,0:00:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切都无力。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光界：确实 在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.35,0:00:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遍布张开的结界魔法{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.24,0:01:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}数冥网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.72,0:01:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那拥有将决斗的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.29,0:01:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}改写掉的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.53,0:01:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须做点什么否则我们毫无胜机……》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.26,0:01:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 数冥直连！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.23,0:01:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}数冥网络发动中时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.19,0:01:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从额外卡组将攻击力1000以下的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.50,0:01:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冠有数冥之名的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.07,0:01:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽4只特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.43,0:01:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要召唤的是 4只 No.怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.06,0:01:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.怪兽！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.07,0:01:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且那4只
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.05,0:01:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最初降临这片大地的 No.们。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.71,0:01:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}持续监视着这片大地地球的守护者！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.11,0:02:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！No.4！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.之门·四！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是真正的 No.4！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.73,0:02:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.72,0:02:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.3！还有2！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.之门·三！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.70,0:02:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.之门·二！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.41,0:02:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而这正是 CNo.的极致。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.76,0:02:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.1！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.35,0:02:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.89,0:02:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.73,0:02:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}摩天撼地的地狱之门坚固的门扉开启之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.87,0:02:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}舍弃那一丝希望吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.57,0:02:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.之门·一！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.54,0:02:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是 No.1！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.们合体了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.19,0:02:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡才是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}配得上神使用的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}门之努梅隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.90,0:03:07.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是攻击力只有1000对吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.53,0:03:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！干掉它！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.23,0:03:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！别说这种轻巧话！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.57,0:03:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.16,0:03:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有攻击力为零的刚巴骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且效果还被无效了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.06,0:03:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)再加上那张 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.31,0:03:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}肯定有什么名堂！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.43,0:03:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！只要对方场上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有卡存在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.90,0:03:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为努梅隆网络的效果我们就无法{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}改写自己的卡。这样啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.94,0:03:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 No.1 门之努梅隆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.80,0:03:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击刚巴骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.53,0:03:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！半·破！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.55,0:03:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合，被攻击的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.71,0:03:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会在战斗中被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.40,0:03:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到的伤害减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.89,0:03:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，这份伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.41,0:03:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会倾注到星光世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.25,0:04:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光世界……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾利法斯)看来开始了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.73,0:05:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决定星光世界与巴利安世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.60,0:05:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未来的战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.08,0:05:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(千尊)怎么样，星光
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.10,0:05:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同你那副身躯一起{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看着星光世界走向毁灭的样子。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔，真恶心啊，千尊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.22,0:05:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)冷静点。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.28,0:06:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之现在先扛住那家伙的攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.93,0:06:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}扛住？愚蠢！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.90,0:06:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.众1 努梅隆·艾卡姆的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗之后 使用超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将努梅隆怪兽的攻击力翻倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.39,0:06:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.41,0:06:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并不存在超量单元。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.10,0:06:22.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼… 只要我还有努梅隆·网络在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.73,0:06:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}努梅隆怪兽 就能不消耗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元直接发动那个效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.64,0:06:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.73,0:06:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}网络又发光了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.30,0:06:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为这个效果 我的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.13,0:06:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部攻击力翻倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.74,0:06:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 我的其他 No.众
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也拥有和这相同的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.23,0:06:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每次战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的怪兽攻击力都会变成２倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.73,0:06:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 到底 该怎么办…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:06:59.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们要赢的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.59,0:07:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就只能破坏 No.网络了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 要怎么做！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们连那张卡在哪里都……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.90,0:07:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.网络的效果发动的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.27,0:07:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遍布这个世界的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.50,0:07:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}网络中闪过了光芒。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕是在地上世界的某处
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.20,0:07:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将 No.代码的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.28,0:07:22.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吸收着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.43,0:07:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 在那前方 No.网络的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.74,0:07:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡片本身应该就存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.27,0:07:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里交给你了 游马 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.79,0:07:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.07,0:07:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咚·千。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.63,0:07:41.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了 游马 鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体。(一千）愚蠢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.06,0:07:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你是去破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}源数网络本身了吧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.28,0:07:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但就算你找到了你们的败北也不会改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.40,0:08:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，见识一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.95,0:08:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}源数之门的真正姿态吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.29,0:08:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.2 源数之门·杜维！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.64,0:08:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击刚霸骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.90,0:08:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这…这就是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.01,0:08:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}源数之门的真正姿态！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.12,0:08:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.09,0:08:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.35,0:08:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再次发动半破！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.77,0:08:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.77,0:08:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.44,0:08:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而我乃 No.2。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.56,0:08:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动源数之门·杜维的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.61,0:08:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力翻倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.27,0:08:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还会再来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.23,0:08:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到星光界找到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.16,0:08:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.网络为止{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.27,0:08:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论如何都要撑住！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:08:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.24,0:08:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.61,0:09:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是 No.3。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用 No.三连击攻击顽抗骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.81,0:09:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动半破！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.25,0:09:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.93,0:09:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是 No.3。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.93,0:09:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 No.三连击的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.58,0:09:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.怪兽的攻击力翻倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.94,0:09:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力8000……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.39,0:09:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去，下次可挡不住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到此为止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.22,0:09:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失吧，游马，纳修。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.89,0:09:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 No.4 No.四重奏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.94,0:09:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击努力骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.58,0:09:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}休想！ 就在这个瞬间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.93,0:09:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}手牌中切入鲨的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.23,0:09:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当怪兽受到攻击时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.26,0:10:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那只怪兽解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.30,0:10:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌将切入鲨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.30,0:10:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.31,0:10:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得救了 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.57,0:10:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.95,0:10:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我 游马 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.07,0:10:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终结之时只是稍微拖延了一下吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾乃 No.４。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.05,0:10:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}努梅隆·查图瓦利的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.63,0:10:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力翻倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.92,0:10:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 16000！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.44,0:10:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完。 当努梅隆网络
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正在发动时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.59,0:10:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾之 No.１
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将努梅隆·艾卡姆混沌化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以升级。什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.43,0:10:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我以 努梅隆·艾卡姆 超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.82,0:10:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量 变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.24,0:10:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.1！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.66,0:11:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么…这次又会出来什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.90,0:11:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏一切秩序，归于混沌之暗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.61,0:11:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将世界引向真正的姿态。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.24,0:11:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌之门·努梅隆·希纽尼亚。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 这只怪兽在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.15,0:11:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}努梅隆·网络没有发动的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.90,0:11:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且混沌·努梅隆·希纽尼亚的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.94,0:11:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤这只怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.34,0:11:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上的所有怪兽除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.24,0:11:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 下一个我的回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.93,0:11:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将 No.1 混沌·努梅隆·希纽尼亚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.88,0:11:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次 回到场上。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这时将因这个效果被除外的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.44,0:11:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其攻击力合计数值的伤害给予对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.56,0:11:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.40,0:11:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.26,0:11:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因辛纽尼亚的效果被除外的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.77,0:11:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力合计是 50000。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.74,0:12:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等下一个那家伙的回合到来 就确实{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们要输了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.29,0:12:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.06,0:12:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 炸弹鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.95,0:12:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙在战斗之后
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然会在结束时被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.57,0:12:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但会将其攻击力数值的伤害给予对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.93,0:12:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动 魔法卡 水属性喷射！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.30,0:12:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 水属性怪兽1只的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.58,0:12:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！ 这样一来就能对那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.39,0:12:34.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用怪兽效果和直接攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.54,0:12:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成4000点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.07,0:12:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不。哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.11,0:12:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.94,0:12:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纽梅隆·网络的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.55,0:12:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.63,0:12:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将卡组的纽梅隆卡送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.59,0:12:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动那个效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.40,0:12:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 反击陷阱{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.37,0:12:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纽梅隆·光之魔法送去墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.90,0:12:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.25,0:13:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当对手的魔法卡发动时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.15,0:13:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效其发动与效果并从对手卡组中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.05,0:13:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将满足发动条件的魔法卡1张{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.07,0:13:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在对手场上发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.98,0:13:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 魔法卡 浮上！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.75,0:13:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 你发动的卡是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.01,0:13:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是发动水泡喷射，而是浮上。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.72,0:13:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又……又被改写卡片了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.59,0:13:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡是，从自己墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.75,0:13:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1只水属性怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.57,0:13:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以表侧守备表示特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将切割鲨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.17,0:13:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.74,0:13:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后爆鲨在自己场上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.45,0:13:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有这张卡以外的怪兽存在时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.03,0:13:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.95,0:13:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.02,0:13:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然这样……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.07,0:13:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在场上游马他们在战斗着。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:13:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.74,0:14:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行，只要梦魇网络还在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.53,0:14:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙就能随意操控我们的卡片……。别放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.93,0:14:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗还没结束呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.33,0:14:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.75,0:14:12.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动速攻魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶魔法·表面 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.39,0:14:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在水属性怪兽被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.54,0:14:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地的时候发动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.74,0:14:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组把升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.83,0:14:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加入手牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.73,0:14:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 千！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.55,0:14:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.44,0:14:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}七皇之剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.07,0:14:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.101。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.06,0:14:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寂静荣誉方舟骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用阶级4的方舟骑士进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.68,0:14:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.74,0:14:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌异热同心变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.101。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.31,0:15:01.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寂静荣誉暗黑骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.24,0:15:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.网络的效果1回合只能使用1次。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.59,0:15:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡片已经无法再被改写了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.13,0:15:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我还要发动暗黑骑士的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将混沌超量单位
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.55,0:15:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地特殊召唤方舟骑士。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太厉害了 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.04,0:15:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}方舟骑士和暗黑骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.24,0:15:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这两只的攻击的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.08,0:15:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修 你这家伙从一开始就瞄准了这个…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.91,0:15:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 我就是让你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.38,0:15:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用了 No.网络的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.33,0:15:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才制造出这个局面的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.05,0:15:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这是被你逼着
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.19,0:15:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行了你所瞄准的改写吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:45.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到此为止了 上千主上！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用方舟骑士 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.09,0:15:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 暗黑骑士直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.74,0:15:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就定了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.09,0:15:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.28,0:16:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将 No.墙以守备表示召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.25,0:16:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中受到伤害时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.51,0:16:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌特殊召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.77,0:16:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并结束那次战斗。什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真遗憾啊 纳修就差那么一点了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.79,0:16:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 上千！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.95,0:16:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.22,0:16:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这个 我找到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.09,0:16:34.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.网络的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.19,0:16:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你找到了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.75,0:16:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你终于找到了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.89,0:16:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上千 这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.网络也到此为止了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.59,0:16:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你能把那张卡破坏掉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.73,0:16:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正有此意 现在就把它取出来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.22,0:16:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要带进决斗场地。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.62,0:17:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。但是 一旦破坏那张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.09,0:17:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个地方蓄积的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.95,0:17:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}庞大能量将失去去处{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.91,0:17:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过已经布满各处的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.80,0:17:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纽美隆网络 逆流{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.58,0:17:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}地上世界也不可能安然无恙吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.74,0:17:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会… 我们的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.26,0:17:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.17,0:17:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了拯救星光世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.41,0:17:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要牺牲地上世界吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.06,0:17:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且若不破坏纽美隆网络{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.75,0:17:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下个我的回合
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们将受到50000点伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后消灭。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.71,0:17:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《某种东西必须牺牲掉什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.29,0:17:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此……》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.26,0:17:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……阿斯特拉尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.63,0:18:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 阿斯特拉尔 你难道……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.74,0:18:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 鲨鱼相信我 把这张卡……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:16.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.45,0:18:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡片飞到那家伙的场上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔 你……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.56,0:18:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动暗黑骑士的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.23,0:18:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方场上的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.22,0:18:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成这张卡的混沌超量单位。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.12,0:18:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑灵魂掠夺者！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.04,0:18:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.93,0:18:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深渊艾尔普西翁。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.08,0:18:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.12,0:18:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有水属性怪兽超量存在时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上的所有卡片{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.27,0:18:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.09,0:19:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.07,0:19:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 梅洛隆网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会… 那！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.59,0:19:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 听得见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.56,0:19:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用担心。这股能量 由我来承受。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.37,0:19:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.57,0:19:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你在说什么啊 你这家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西 要是承受了的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道你 从一开始就打算自己！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.73,0:19:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 我把所有的 No.托付给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}之后就交给你了 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋 别开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.24,0:19:57.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你只有你一个人牺牲什么的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.40,0:20:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事我绝对 不允许！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.07,0:20:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.09,0:20:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见了 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.75,0:20:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊… 你是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}艾利法斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.29,0:20:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.81,0:20:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么是你？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.41,0:20:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在走上错误道路的阿斯特拉尔世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.71,0:20:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}名为希望与羁绊的全新力量诞生了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.60,0:20:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因你与游马而诞生。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.90,0:20:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}艾利法斯 你……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.77,0:20:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔 你还不能消失。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.59,0:20:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将未来托付给你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.48,0:20:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}艾利法斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.45,0:20:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.21,0:20:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.54,0:21:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}艾利法斯 多管闲事。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.23,0:21:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？ 为什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.58,0:21:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.25,0:21:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}艾利法斯说了。要将未来托付给我们。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.04,0:21:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我不能哭哭啼啼的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.60,0:21:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}众多同伴的心意继承了他们意志的我们……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.75,0:21:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.17,0:21:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗，我们一定要赢！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.74,0:21:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是当然！上吧，三千！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.36,0:21:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动暗黑骑士的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.83,0:21:38.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}持有混沌超量单位的这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.25,0:21:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.23,0:21:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会复活到自己的场上。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.64,0:21:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，按照暗黑骑士的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.81,0:21:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的生命值会回复！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.83,0:21:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.25,0:22:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.12,0:22:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们绝对不会输！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}三千！

